   <title><![CDATA[Ep. 187: The Courage to Speak Out - An Update with Dr. Eithan Haim [The Outstanding Podcast]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>In this powerful follow-up episode, Dr. Eithan Haim, who first joined us in March 2024 after blowing the whistle on Texas Children&rsquo;s Hospital&rsquo;s secretive transgender program for minors, shares his whirlwind legal journey fighting the Biden DOJ, what made him decide to blow the whistle, and what he has learned over the course of this year. Listen today to be encouraged by one man&rsquo;s courageous stand for truth!</p>]]></description>
   <author><![CDATA[Joseph Backholm]]></author>
